    "description": "Full search flow through searchStore: local substring search across a post array (exact match, partial match, no match) → global FTS5 search via IPC (searchPosts) → mixed search with folder filter → empty query (must return empty/nothing) → single-character search (boundary: 'a') → search history tracking (last 10 searches) → abort controller: call search twice rapidly with different terms, verify only the second completes. Tests CJK and emoji query terms.",
